# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Non-US Global App & Web Services Complete Rule-Set (APP_SERVICE.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Exhaustive coverage of non-US global internet ecosystems (UK, EU,
#              Japan, Korea, APAC, HK/TW, Canada, Australia, Russia & Offshore)
#              inaccessible or throttled in China Mainland. Covers main sites,
#              dedicated CDNs, static assets, APIs, auth & media streaming domains.
#              Strictly excludes US services (in USA_SERVICE.list), China domestic
#              services (in China.list), AI services (in AGI.list) & brand lists.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/APP_SERVICE.list,"🌀 Automatic",extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

